# Generated run output (AI-509 Ticket 3 conventions): one
# `results/<version>.jsonl` per run, where `--version` defaults to the UTC
# date, holding a raw agent transcript tail per cell. Not committed — a run
# needs live developer credentials, so nobody else can reproduce or refresh the
# file, and the transcripts are the noisiest thing this suite produces. The
# analyses worth keeping are hand-written into reports/ instead.
results/
